     it to the staging cert file; prod is untouched and still verified. Requires having the cert on disk.
  2. [1mScope the bypass to staging[0m — a [38;5;153mREPORTS_VERIFY_TLS[39m env var, default [38;5;153mTrue[39m, set to false only in [38;5;153msync_staging.py[39m.
     Cheaper, but the off-switch exists in shared code and can be flipped for prod later.
  3. [1mWhat you asked for[0m — [38;5;153mverify=False[39m on both calls, production included.

